{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.TopologicalChargeQuantization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.TopologicalChargeQuantization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.topological_charge_quantization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.topological_charge_quantization","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/topological-charge-quantization.lean#L39-L54","doc":"The quantized-topological-charge condition, as a **predicate** on the\ncategorical data: the Reeb residue operator `Res_ξ`, post-composed with\nthe observer trace `Φ`, leaves `Φ` unchanged — `Res_ξ ≫ Φ = Φ`.\nEquivalently the algebraic residue `Res_q(ω, 1) = Φ(Res_ξ(ω)) = 1`\n(with `1 = id_{𝟙}` in the monoidal unit).\n\nNamed (§3b), not asserted: the previous `(h_reeb_residue : P) : P := h`\nwas self-assuming and stated nothing. Integrality of the total charge is\nforced by non-degeneracy of the Frobenius pairing and periodicity of the\nReeb derivation `ξ_q` — the algebraic Gauss–Bonnet content — which lives\nin the substrate, not at this abstraction, so this names the condition. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:topological-charge-quantization","label":"conj:topological-charge-quantization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/topological-charge-quantization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}